      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You can frame this by focusing on the historical necessity of change, which is the core of progressive thought. Introduce concepts like social justice and systemic inequality, showing how movements push society toward a more equitable future. Contrast this with resistance movements, which are often rooted in preserving an established, but flawed, status quo. The goal is to show that progress is not always comfortable, but it is always the direction of societal improvement.",
